  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s13/6d2afb4c> ;
  triage:notes "Partially-present: real test-run evidence exists (genuine cargo-test/CLI transcripts) but is attached to an inaccurate PASS claim. The evidence files contain no non-loopback IP addresses; they document loopback-only behavior, not the self-IP-against-real-interface proof required by AG-VAL-019/020. Fix requires either: (a) correct the checklist rows back to PENDING/FAIL with accurate description of what was actually proven (loopback routing only), or (b) produce genuine non-loopback-interface evidence showing actual self-IP binding and cross-host communication." .

